   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="note">
     <property name="text">
      <string>Uses complete numeric channels before display crop, value bounds or overlay alignment. Shapes and sample coordinates must match; no broadcasting or resampling. XY signals require the same unique, uniform X grid. Color composites use their numeric grayscale fusion channels. Polar magnitude must be linear and nonnegative. NaN / Inf remain gaps. The result is a new complex matrix; source arrays are unchanged.</string>
     </property>
